      "name": "Open EU-wide evidence on grassland (habitat 62A0) in Natura 2000 site SI3000276 Kras: run 2026-10-22",
      "description": "Process Run Crate of one execution of the EU-data and species layers of the study. Verdict: EU-wide open data: inconclusive at site level. DRAFT: not deposited; draft; not reviewed by an ecologist or by the Slovenian Distributed Centre (ZRC SAZU).",
